{"id":"9e4036f3b2c8bb56","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-stalk.md","title":"Stalk","display":"df-stalk — Stalk","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stalk","aliases":["58-df-stalk"],"display":"df-stalk — Stalk","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stalk"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stalk</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stalk — Stalk"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2cb2118f43b23b3\" href=\"?note=b2cb2118f43b23b3\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>-值 sheaf 谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2cb2118f43b23b3\" href=\"?note=b2cb2118f43b23b3\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_x,E_x,R_x\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal N_x,E_x,R_x\\in V\\)</span>（开邻域集、带代表元集与 germ 等价关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_W:\\mathcal F(U)\\to\\mathcal F(W)\">\\(\\rho^U_W:\\mathcal F(U)\\to\\mathcal F(W)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq U\">\\(W\\subseteq U\\)</span> 的限制映射）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q]_{R_x}\">\\([q]_{R_x}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in E_x\">\\(q\\in E_x\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_x\">\\(R_x\\)</span>-等价类）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_x\">\\(\\mathcal F_x\\)</span>（在上述 sheaf 数据下定义的 stalk 载体）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}neighborhoods}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal N_x\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathcal T:x\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}neighborhoods}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal N_x\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathcal T:x\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nE_x\\coloneqq\\{\\langle U,s\\rangle:U\\in\\mathcal N_x\\land s\\in\\mathcal F(U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nE_x\\coloneqq\\{\\langle U,s\\rangle:U\\in\\mathcal N_x\\land s\\in\\mathcal F(U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}germ\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nR_x\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\left\\langle\\langle U,s\\rangle,\\langle V,t\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in E_x^2:\n\\exists W\\in\\mathcal N_x\\;\\bigl(\nW\\subseteq U\\cap V\n\\land\\rho^U_W(s)=\\rho^V_W(t)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}germ\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nR_x\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\left\\langle\\langle U,s\\rangle,\\langle V,t\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in E_x^2:\n\\exists W\\in\\mathcal N_x\\;\\bigl(\nW\\subseteq U\\cap V\n\\land\\rho^U_W(s)=\\rho^V_W(t)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal F_x\\coloneqq\\{[q]_{R_x}:q\\in E_x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal F_x\\coloneqq\\{[q]_{R_x}:q\\in E_x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>以反包含次序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\preceq V\\leftrightarrow V\\subseteq U\">\\(U\\preceq V\\leftrightarrow V\\subseteq U\\)</span> 排列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_x\">\\(\\mathcal N_x\\)</span> 时，限制映射沿有向系统的箭头前进。</li>\n<li>每个邻域截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathcal F(U)\">\\(s\\in\\mathcal F(U)\\)</span> 有典范 germ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\langle U,s\\rangle]_{R_x}\\in\\mathcal F_x\">\\([\\langle U,s\\rangle]_{R_x}\\in\\mathcal F_x\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有典范同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_x\\cong\\varinjlim_{(\\mathcal N_x,\\preceq)}\\mathcal F(U)\">\\(\\mathcal F_x\\cong\\varinjlim_{(\\mathcal N_x,\\preceq)}\\mathcal F(U)\\)</span>；这是 quotient 构造后的性质，不应接在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coloneqq\">\\(\\coloneqq\\)</span> 右端形成“对象等于一个同构命题”的类型错误。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)$（$\\mathcal C$-值 sheaf 谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal F,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_x,E_x,R_x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^U_W:\\mathcal F(U)\\to\\mathcal F(W)","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"[q]_{R_x}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in E_x","display":false},{"tex":"R_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}neighborhoods}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal N_x\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathcal T:x\\in U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nE_x\\coloneqq\\{\\langle U,s\\rangle:U\\in\\mathcal N_x\\land s\\in\\mathcal F(U)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}germ\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\nR_x\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\left\\langle\\langle U,s\\rangle,\\langle V,t\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\in E_x^2:\n\\exists W\\in\\mathcal N_x\\;\\bigl(\nW\\subseteq U\\cap V\n\\land\\rho^U_W(s)=\\rho^V_W(t)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stalk\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\land x\\in X\n\\to\n\\mathcal F_x\\coloneqq\\{[q]_{R_x}:q\\in E_x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U\\preceq V\\leftrightarrow V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_x","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathcal F(U)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\langle U,s\\rangle]_{R_x}\\in\\mathcal F_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_x\\cong\\varinjlim_{(\\mathcal N_x,\\preceq)}\\mathcal F(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\coloneqq","display":false}],"bytes":2092,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-stalk.md|58-df-stalk]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["b2cb2118f43b23b3"]}